Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:00.30,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（蒙特利尔）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:00.30,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}谢尔顿 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 7-6(4){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 中岛布兰登 · 赛后亚军致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, first of all, big congratulations to Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 要特别恭喜谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, great level this whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周的水准都很高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, congrats to you and your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,your family, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,on incredible incredible week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出了了不起的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of people don't realize how hard it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多人没意识到卫冕有多难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.36,EN,,0,0,0,,is to go back to back, especially in uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其还是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in different cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,两座不同的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh, it's it's simply incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这真的太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'd like to say thank you to my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, all you guys over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在那边的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys so much for uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for all your help, all support.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,和所有的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, not just this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.12,EN,,0,0,0,,my whole my whole career, so many uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的整个职业生涯 有那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,so many people behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在幕后付出的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh really appreciate all their support
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很感激他们的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,for for everyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢在场的每一位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:59.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and and also back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢在家乡的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, of course, also thank you to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 还要谢谢我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,My dad's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,my mom is back uh back home watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我妈妈在家里看着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, my brother is uh in college right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我弟弟现在在上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh, I really have all of them to to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我职业生涯的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,for uh, for everything in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,都要谢谢他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, big thank you to uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要特别感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to all the sponsors, all the organization uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有赞助商 所有组织方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in this incredible tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,办了这么棒的一站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you know, I felt really great the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the whole week here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉都特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and uh it really is one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of the best best weeks of my my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我人生中最好的一周之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:53.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh really appreciate everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:53.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的很感激每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,all the uh all the staff, all the ball kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有工作人员 所有球童
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you guys truly do an amazing job
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们把这站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,with this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,办得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:08.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So uh thank you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:12.04,EN,,0,0,0,,for all your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有的辛苦付出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, big thank you to all the crowd that uh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要特别谢谢这十天里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:25.56,EN,,0,0,0,,that came out these uh these past 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到现场的所有观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,The uh the support you guys give
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们给这站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to the tournament and all the players,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和所有球员的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,uh it's really unlike anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是别的地方比不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh and I'm going to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说句实话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,really really enjoy here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:47.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in Montreal more than more than Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,比在多伦多更开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not I'm not just saying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不是因为今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that sitting here in the final today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,坐在这里打决赛才这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,but even before this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这一周之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,really enjoy my time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就很享受在这儿的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks to uh all the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢这里所有的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Feels uh such like home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这儿感觉就像家一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:42.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So uh really appreciate all you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的很感激你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:49.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,uh we'll be back in Toronto next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,明年我们要回多伦多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh but I I uh I I really look forward
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我真的很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.30,EN,,0,0,0,,to coming back here in uh in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,两年后再回到这里
